- (P13) t_Q <= S2/(4QV) from (x-Q)_+ <= x^2/(4Q);
- (P14) the shell bound;
- (P16-P17) the bounded-variable concentration corollary, risk <= 2J exp(-2n(r/Q)^2);
- (P19) conditional power;
- (P20-P22) the full-law confidence interval, prediction set and T+2D precision guard.
